<title>DUBAI: Qatar Airways to launch Frankfurt route.</title>
<headline>Qatar Airways to launch Frankfurt route.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-08-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qatar Airways will begin flights to Frankfurt in November, the official Qatar News Agency reported on Saturday.</p>
<p>It quoted the company's chief executive, Sheikh Hamad bin Ali bin Jabr al-Thani, as saying the airline would fly to Frankfurt twice a week.</p>
<p>Al-Thani said earlier this month that the two-year-old airline expects to add another five destinations to its route network before the end of the year, bringing the total to 31.</p>
